{"id":"n1-200","title":"～とすると (〜to suru to)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses 'if', 'when', or 'assuming that' in a speculative sense.","longExplanation":"The ～とすると grammar point is used for hypothetical or speculative situations, often in the sense of 'if we assume...', 'when it comes to...', or 'given that...' . It sets up a condition and then states the expected or possible outcome.","formation":"Verb-casual + とすると / い-Adjective + とすると / な-Adjective + だとすると / Noun + だとすると","examples":[{"jp":"彼が来るとすると、もうすぐ到着するはずです。","romaji":"Kare ga kuru to suru to, mou sugu touchaku suru hazu desu.","en":"If he’s coming, he should arrive soon.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来る","vocabId":"1547720","reading":"くる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"もうすぐ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"到着","vocabId":"1449870","reading":"とうちゃく"},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"はず","vocabId":"1476430","reading":"はず"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"この仕事を終えるとすると、最低でも3日はかかるでしょう。","romaji":"Kono shigoto o oeru to suru to, saitei demo mikka wa kakaru deshou.","en":"Assuming we finish this work, it will take at least three days.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"仕事","vocabId":"1304970","reading":"しごと"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"終える","vocabId":"1332760","reading":"おえる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"最低","vocabId":"1294220","reading":"さいてい"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"3","vocabId":null},{"surface":"日","vocabId":"1463770","reading":"ひ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"かかる","vocabId":"1207590","reading":"かかる"},{"surface":"でしょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6]},{"jp":"戦争が起きるとすると、多くの人々が犠牲になるでしょう。","romaji":"Sensou ga okiru to suru to, ooku no hitobito ga gisei ni naru deshou.","en":"If a war were to break out, many people would become victims.","words":[{"surface":"戦争","vocabId":"1390360","reading":"せんそう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"起きる","vocabId":"1223640","reading":"おきる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"多く","vocabId":"1861770","reading":"おおく"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"人々","vocabId":"1580650","reading":"ひとびと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"犠牲","vocabId":"1225450","reading":"ぎせい"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なる","vocabId":"1532910","reading":"なる"},{"surface":"でしょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"彼が経営者だとすると、多くの責任を負うことになるでしょう。","romaji":"Kare ga keieisha da to suru to, ooku no sekinin o ou koto ni naru deshou.","en":"If he’s the manager, he will bear a lot of responsibility.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"経営","vocabId":"1251130","reading":"けいえい"},{"surface":"者","vocabId":"1322990","reading":"もの"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"多く","vocabId":"1861770","reading":"おおく"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"責任","vocabId":"1383180","reading":"せきにん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"負う","vocabId":"1497930","reading":"おう"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なる","vocabId":"1532910","reading":"なる"},{"surface":"でしょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7]}],"formalityLevel":"very-formal-literary","usageNote":"Formal, literary \"assuming that/if we suppose\" - speculative register.","family":{"id":"conditional","name":"Conditional (If / Assuming That)","relatedPoints":["n2-007","n3-107","n3-109","n2-056","n1-191","n1-046","n2-177"]}}